Debug.Assert(Old_index < arrList.Count);
Debug.Assert(New_containsNewRet); // check if array list contains new ret
Debug.Assert(Old_index < Old_arrListCount); // old index is less than or same as old array count 
```

Please note that you need to import the System.Diagnostics namespace for the Debug.Assert function. Also, these assertions won't output anything unless Pex (a Microsoft's Fuzzing Testing Tool) is used on this code.--------------------Here is the required C# code:

